#. type: Title-text
#: ../scene.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Mover 1"
msgstr "Trasporto 1"

#. type: Resume-text
#: ../scene.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Retrieve some titanium ore in order to convert it to titanium cubes."
msgstr "Recupera minerale di titanio per convertirlo in cubi."

#. type: ScriptName-text
#: ../scene.txt:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Mover"
msgstr "Mover"

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exercise"
msgstr "Esercizio"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Convert some <a object|titanore>titanium ore</a> to <a object|titan>titanium"
" cubes</a>, then drop 2 titanium cubes on the pads whose coordinates are:"
msgstr ""
"Converti il <a object|titanore>minerale</a> in <a object|titan>cubi di "
"titanio</a>, poi posa 2 cubi sulle piattaforme alle coordinate:"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\tx=10, y=-60\n"
"\tx=10, y=-65"
msgstr ""
"\tx=10, y=-60\n"
"\tx=10, y=-65"

#. type: Image filename
#: ../help/help.E.txt:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "derrick"
msgstr "derrick"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:8
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The <a object|derrick>derrick</a> extracts titanium ore from the subsoil; "
"you just have to pick it up."
msgstr ""
"La <a object|derrick>torre di estrazione</a> estrae il minerale dal "
"sottosuolo: devi soltanto raccoglierlo."

#. type: Image filename
#: ../help/help.E.txt:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "convert"
msgstr "convert"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The <a object|convert>converter</a> converts titanium ore to titanium cubes."
" Just drop the titanium ore on the platform, move backward, and wait until "
"it has been converted."
msgstr ""
"Il <a object|convert>convertitore</a> trasforma il minerale in cubi. Posa il"
" minerale sulla piattaforma, arretra e attendi la conversione."

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "General principle"
msgstr "Principio generale"

#. type: Bullet: 'o'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Wait until there is some titanium ore."
msgstr "Attendi la presenza di minerale di titanio."

#. type: Bullet: 'o'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Go to the titanium ore."
msgstr "Raggiungi il minerale."

#. type: Bullet: 'o'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pick it up."
msgstr "Prendilo."

#. type: Bullet: 'o'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Go to the converter."
msgstr "Raggiungi il convertitore."

#. type: Bullet: 'o'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Drop the titanium ore."
msgstr "Posa il minerale."

#. type: Bullet: 'o'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Move back 2.5 meters."
msgstr "Arretra di 2,5 metri."

#. type: Bullet: 'o'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Wait until there is a titanium cube."
msgstr "Attendi la presenza di un cubo di titanio."

#. type: Bullet: 'o'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pick up the titanium cube."
msgstr "Prendi il cubo."

#. type: Bullet: 'o'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Go to the platform."
msgstr "Raggiungi la piattaforma."

#. type: Bullet: 'o'
#: ../help/help.E.txt:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Drop the titanium cube."
msgstr "Posa il cubo."

#. type: \b; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Useful instructions"
msgstr "Istruzioni utili"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:27
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<code><a cbot|for>for</a></code> to repeat some instructions\n"
"<code><a cbot|do>do - while</a></code> to repeat some instructions\n"
"<code><a cbot|radar>radar</a></code> to look for different objects\n"
"<code><a cbot|goto>goto</a></code> to move the bot\n"
"<code><a cbot|grab>grab</a></code> to grab an object\n"
"<code><a cbot|drop>drop</a></code> to drop an object"
msgstr ""
"<code><a cbot|for>for</a></code> per ripetere istruzioni\n"
"<code><a cbot|do>do - while</a></code> per ripetere istruzioni\n"
"<code><a cbot|radar>radar</a></code> per cercare oggetti\n"
"<code><a cbot|goto>goto</a></code> per spostare il robot\n"
"<code><a cbot|grab>grab</a></code> per prendere un oggetto\n"
"<code><a cbot|drop>drop</a></code> per posarlo"

#. type: \t; header
#: ../help/help.E.txt:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "See also"
msgstr "Vedi anche"

